Z||000000||JetroGT||01-15-2000||06:14 PM||||<BR>I found a 87 GT kind of off to the side at a used car lot. It has front end damage but that's all. It looks as if it's been sitting a while. It's a 5spd with all the options except the sunroof. I noticed red paint under the blue on the crushed front cover. Can someone tell me if this is a real blue GT?<BR>I copied the VIN. 1G2PG1193HP230250<BR>I tried some of the VIN decoder pages trying to find the origional color. If it really is a Blue GT I would like to restore it.||||reg||7
Z||000001||Phil||01-15-2000||06:53 PM||||Paint is not in the VIN  it should be on the sticker on the driver side front fender well inside by the brake booster. But you said red "under" the blue hmmmmmmm||||reg||1
Z||000002||JetroGT||01-15-2000||08:11 PM||||Good. I'll go back on Monday when someone is there. What's the paint code for blue?||||reg||1
